      "id": "C03-01",
      "subtitles_zh": "补给和人数会变，还要问变化发生在哪个窗口。军队面板的“每月损耗”给出当前比例和人数，是眼前条件下的计算提示。要讲已经少了多少兵，就需要完整兵团的前后人数，并检查有没有补员、战斗、分合军或其他事件。",
      "subtitles_en": "When supply or strength changes, we need to identify the observation window. “Monthly Attrition” shows the current percentage and soldiers per month, calculated under present conditions. To say how many soldiers have already been lost, compare every regiment before and after. Check for reinforcement, combat, splitting or merging, and other events too.",
