      "id": "C03-02",
      "subtitles_zh": "比如一月十一日的暂停样本，当前围城损失预算是五十六。它能说明眼前相关条件怎么算，不是一条刚刚扣了五十六人的记录。预算与真正发生的减少分开，才不会把一个提示数重复记入结果。",
      "subtitles_en": "For example, at a paused January 11 observation, the current siege loss budget was 56. It describes the calculation under relevant current conditions, not a record saying 56 soldiers were just removed. Keeping the budget separate from an actual decrease prevents us from counting a tooltip number as a result.",
