      "id": "C03-03",
      "subtitles_zh": "较早的一次围城观察，分队从三千一百二十人变成三千零八十九，净少三十一。同期补给从约八十三降到七十四点二三，两端都高于五十。可以讲围城背景下的周期变化和实际兵员减少，不能把这段说成饥饿。",
      "subtitles_en": "In an earlier siege observation, the detachment went from 3,120 to 3,089 soldiers: a net loss of 31. Supply fell from about 83 to 74.23, with both endpoints above 50. We can describe a periodic change under siege conditions and actual soldier losses. We cannot call this starvation.",
